dialect protocol
protocol json.mutations
version 1
schema stdio.json
start record

# P2-P1: REAL binary op frame, replacing F6's `print_op().into_bytes()` text-as-binary shortcut
# (`🔣️json/…/🧬️mutations/🦀️component.rs`'s old `OpBinary::encode_op` — see that file's `#region
# OpCodecs` for the upgraded implementation). `JsonMutation` is a genuine data-carrying enum whose
# variants embed a recursive `JsonValue`/`JsonPath` (itself a data-carrying `Vec<enum>`) — no
# `DslField` impl exists or can exist for either (blanket impls cover only ints/bool/String/Vec<T
# where T: DslField>/BTreeMap/[T;N]/DslValue/Wire, never a data-carrying enum), so the generic
# `format u8 | ordinal varint | record body` layout (`pack_rt::encode_record_body` /
# `dsl::variants_binary::encode_op`, which both require a `RecordSpec` derived FROM a `DslField`
# impl) genuinely does not fit — confirmed by re-reading the type, not assumed. Handcrafted instead:
# `format u8` (`store::OP_BINARY_FORMAT` convention) + `tag u8` (the `JsonMutation` variant ordinal,
# same 0-6 ordering as `parse_json_mutation`'s keyword match) as two REAL fixed fields, then the
# variant's own recursive path/key/value payload as one opaque trailing `bytes` chain.
#
# The recursive payload itself is real LEB128-varint-framed binary (`enc_json_value_bin`/
# `enc_json_path_bin` in the same `🦀️component.rs`, reusing `store::pack_rt::write_varint_u64` /
# `store::ByteReader`) — NOT re-modeled field-by-field here because `Prim::Ref` (the only construct
# that could describe JsonValue's self-recursion at the protocol-dialect level) unconditionally
# errors during `walk_protocol` (confirmed live, P2-M2's own recorded open question — recursive
# protocol structures were explicitly out of that wave's scope, not fixed by this wave either). This
# is the same honest-boundary treatment the plan itself prescribes for a compressed payload segment
# — opaque at the protocol layer, genuinely structured (and round-trip-tested) at the Rust layer.
# Filed as `mechanism_gaps` in this wave's report (non-blocking; worked around locally exactly as
# described here).
framing record
header fixed 2
field format u8
field tag u8
chain payload bytes
